This repository holds three kinds of material. NOTICE.md says which files
are which; THIRD-PARTY.md gives the terms of the third kind.

1. The project's own work: the tools, scripts, Ghidra scripts, documents,
   the status page, and the names, comments, descriptions, type headers
   and tables the project wrote. The MIT License below covers this.
2. The reconstructed source of the game program (source/, source_test/,
   src/, src_test/). The program it expresses belongs to its owners. The
   MIT License below covers only the project's own annotations in those
   files; it grants nothing over the program itself. See NOTICE.md.
3. Code that comes from other projects, under their own terms. See
   THIRD-PARTY.md.

